WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.220
Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier and welcome back to OneShot.

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:06.400
Now we're waking up from the darkness... I am still here!

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.720
Hello. "It happened again. Everything just went really dark."

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:12.520
"So dark, the light bulb doesn't even light it!"

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.440
Oh, it's okay Niko!

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:18.520
It's gonna be okay, don't worry... oopsie poopsie.

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:24.260
Okay, so where we last left off we, made the bottle of acid and then we cleaned off the RowBOT

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:28.920
Whose actual name IS RowBOT. But, I haven't talked to the head engineer left

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:34.060
So, that must be-"I would have given you coordinates, buuut my system's down"?

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:38.860
So that must be Silver, whoo, well it's either Silver...

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:43.120
...or it's this mysterious person that's still working deep in the mines.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:45.600
Either way we gotta go over there so I'll be right back.

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:46.520
Maybe...

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:48.280
Oh!

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.200
Hi...

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:51.220
I thought you were dead..

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:52.100
Hello?

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:54.500
"HELLO SMALL PERSON."

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.300
"You're not much bigger than I am."

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:58.460
"WELCOME To the lookout point."

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:01.220
"Below us is the old quarry."

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:03.700
"The head engineer lives a little more to the East."

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:06.840
"The entrance to the old mines is further to the East."

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:07.460
"I see!

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:09.740
Thank you very much for that!

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:17.380
It's so weird considering you're up and walking again, so how far out did that battery reach? Like that actually went a long way.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:19.300
Silver! Are you the head engineer?!

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:23.720
"Excuse me again miss..I found a robot who can take me towards the tower."

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:26.600
"but it's having some trouble, so it told me to talk to you."

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:28.600
"Alright. What is the issue?"

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:32.640
"It said something about its navigation circuits being fried."

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.940
"Just the navigation circuits?"

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:38.380
"Apparently! Markiplier and I fixed everything else, I think..."

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:41.720
"I have something that may help."

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:46.280
"RowBOTs have the ability to trace material from their source locations."

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:51.760
"If you let the RowBOT borrow this, then its backup tracking system should activate."

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:54.180
Uh.. OOOOOOOO.

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:56.160
It's a clover!

00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:00.640
Wait, are you saying those clovers that other bot was by aren't from here?

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:02.900
"That's a very pretty necklace. What's it made of?"

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:06.060
"Amber found from the Glen."

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:07.540
"What's this thing inside the amber?"

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:11.760
"The black clover? That's a common plant in our world."

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:13.040
It's also...

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:15.420
*Sigh*

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:18.660
"I'm not sure if I can bear to part with this."

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:23.080
"My programming says yes, but I still feel conflicted."

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:25.000
"Nevermind."

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:29.680
"You need to finish your mission more than I need a keepsake. Here."

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:31.060
Oh, thank you!

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.480
I don't know what it means to them...

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:38.520
And this Silver, the head engineer, supposedly is "tamed", whatever that means,

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:42.340
But she still has programming, because obviously she's a robot.

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:43.080
But

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.800
She's conflicted.

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:47.980
"Before I go, is there anything I can do in return?"

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:52.220
"Actually... Do you know how to play chess?"

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:54.740
"Yeah! Well, sort of."

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:56.540
"I've played it with some older kids before."

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.780
"Then, will you play a game with me?"

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:03.580
"I mean, I don't know the rules very well, but I guess it's the least I could do!"

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:07.500
Alright, I'll give it a go. I'm a complete amateur at chess.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.880
"You're really good at this!" "Thank you."

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.020
I AM A COMPUTER AFTER ALL.

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:16.440
"It was built into my code." "Ah. So, what's it like?"

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:18.020
"Being a robot and all."

00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:22.200
"I've talked to other robots, and they all talk about programming and code and stuff."

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:23.860
I don't really understand it at all.

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:25.580
"Even you did, just now!"

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:27.580
"It's a little hard to understand sometimes."

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:31.740
"I know. Most of the robots here are not tamed."

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:32.980
"Tamed?"

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:34.340
"Watch out."

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:36.160
"There goes my bishop."

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:39.140
"Taming is complicated."

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:42.440
"Oh? How complicated exactly?"

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:47.160
"There goes my other bishop." Okay, alright then.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:50.320
"I can't really explain what tamed robots are."

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.060
"But I'm one of them."

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:55.840
"All the other tamed robots have been moved to other regions."

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:58.960
"Exactly where, I don't know."

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:02.740
"There goes my little horse."

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:05.260
"Knight." Right.

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:09.860
"Oh, have you ever been to any of the other regions? I heard that there's two more."

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:11.580
"In the past, yes."

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:15.240
"I still have the data, the coordinates, the memories."

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:18.080
"I don't know how much of that still holds true."

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:21.120
"The world may be a very different place now."

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:24.100
"Because the sun is gone?" "No."

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:26.100
"I said this already, didn't I?"

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:29.300
"The sun probably won't save the world"

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:32.680
"The decaying started back before the sun went out"

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:38.840
"The sun's sudden death was just the tipping point, and things went south really fast after that"

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:42.300
"Then... there's nothing I can do?"

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:43.340
"check."

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:46.200
"WHAT! When did your queen get there?"

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:49.580
"The only thing you can do is complete your pilgrimage."

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:54.120
"In a way, you are only supposed to be a second chance for the people."

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:59.000
"Just like how the Barrens was only supposed to be a second chance for me."

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:02.220
"There's no guarantee that things will work out."

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:04.280
But... "Checkmate."

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:09.220
WELL I'M BAD AT THIS. Even Markiplier, the God, couldn't help you, Niko.

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:13.100
"Alright, guess I've kept you long enough. Thank you for listening."

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:15.800
"I hope you get home safely."

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:17.440
"Oh, thank you also!"

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.080
Awww!

00:05:19.240 --> 00:05:24.360
That's so sad. What is going on in this world that's causing all these problems?

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:28.800
Hello! "Off you go. There's no reason for you to linger in the Barrens."

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:31.500
I mean, I imagine I'm going to come back if there's gonna be...

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:35.000
I mean, there's still someone down in the mines. Does that not mean anything?

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:37.260
There's no vehicle with which to go down there, is there?

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:42.360
I mean, Silver's not accompanying me, so I gotta imagine that...

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:45.980
"Safety violation!" Stranger danger! Okay.

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:50.040
So... I mean, I have the amber necklace, so I'm assuming...

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:56.280
Yeah, I'm assuming that I just go to the rowboat and go on my way, so I'll be back, I guess.

00:05:56.720 --> 00:05:59.920
Man, sucks to leave this place. It's so sad here.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:03.060
Like, why is it so sad?

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:05.540
I meant, I got to imagine that the...

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:10.020
The drearyness and the night is falling, the further away you get from the center,

00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:11.520
or maybe it's all this way.

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:15.140
And again, what's with this black... corruption... here?

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:16.720
The black squares.

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:18.940
Someone else was mentioning that in a note.

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:23.020
Either way, I'll find out in just a bit. Be back in a second.

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:25.860
Okay buddy, I think I got what you need...

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:28.580
How 'bout we do a little bit of... uhhhhh...

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:31.300
THERE we go. Forgot my buttons. Hello!

00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:31.800
I...

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:35.080
"OH!"

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:37.980
"This is amber from the glen!"

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:39.340
"I CAN REMEMBER NOW!"

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:41.400
"ACTIVATING TRACKING SYSTEM..."

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:42.700
"SETTING COURSE..."

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:43.900
"WAIT."

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:45.720
"THIS BOAT IS OVER CAPACITY."

00:06:46.140 --> 00:06:47.680
"YOU'LL NEED TO LEAVE BEHIND SOME OF YOUR POSSESSIONS."

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:48.700
"Oh."

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:51.080
"Well, I don't think I'll be needing this crowbar anymore..."

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:53.320
"Or this gas mask &amp; gloves..."

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:55.340
Ok, yes, dump 'em right in the ocean!

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:57.580
Yeah! Just litter all over the place!

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:00.160
Sea turtles gonna get caught in that crowbar.

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:01.620
"THAT IS ACCEPTABLE."

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:03.900
"ONWARDS WE GO~!"

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:06.180
Ladadee...

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:07.680
Oh!

00:07:08.180 --> 00:07:10.660
Ah! So pretty! He's built into the boat!

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:13.300
Awww, what a little goober!

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:14.300
Oh no.

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:15.600
Oh no!

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:18.540
Are those the leeches?

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:22.740
Are those the Lake Lacrymose leeches?

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:24.700
Hope you didn't eat anything, Niko.

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:25.940
You're about to be torn apart.

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:26.940
Oh!

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:28.000
What is this?

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:29.960
"HERE IS YOUR STOP. THE GLEN."

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:31.140
"Thank you!"

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.200
"THERE SHOULD BE A VILLAGE TO THE NORTH."

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:34.940
"BUT THAT'S ALL I CAN RECALL."

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:36.180
"Oh, that's good to know!"

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:38.340
"FAREWELL~!"

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:40.420
"May your mission be a success."

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:41.300
"Are you leaving?"

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:42.600
"YES."

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:44.900
"I MUST RETURN TO MY STATION."

00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:46.540
"But you'll be all alone again..."

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:48.360
"IT'S OKAY."

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:50.140
"I HAVE NOT BEEN TAMED."

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:55.960
Again, I don't know what that means. Everyone keeps referring to that but I don't know what that means.

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:59.200
Weird. So what is the concept of being tamed?

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:01.220
Am I ever gonna be able to go back there?

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:05.120
I don't think I explored every nook and cr-oooohhhway...

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:07.060
Ah...

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.860
Well, I'm one step closer to the tower, I guess.

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:12.960
But this place doesn't look good.

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:14.960
Looks like a cemetery here.

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:20.080
Oh.. That's beautiful but.. kinda sad in a way.

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:22.260
I mean the other place was sad too but...

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:23.940
Yeah, I don't know.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:25.860
What is all this?

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:29.420
I mean there's another dock over there but there was no other way to go but this.

00:08:30.180 --> 00:08:31.700
I mean this place is just filled...

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:34.520
With the clovers, which I was told is common.

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:36.600
Oh, hey! How's i going there?

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:38.540
"This jar is full of fireflies."

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:41.520
Uh. "I'm catching fireflies for mommy!"

00:08:41.960 --> 00:08:46.160
Ok, do you have a candle on your head or is that a feather orrrrr I, I... don't know what's going on there.

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:47.820
Little bizarre.

00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:49.120
The hell is going on?

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:51.100
"Filled with small, dried fish."

00:08:51.100 --> 00:08:52.020
Where am I!?

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:53.180
Hello!

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:55.900
"There was a time when our people used to live in these ruins.

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:59.120
"But due to flooding, most of us have moved to less permanent settlements."

00:08:59.540 --> 00:09:00.120
"Flooding?"

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:02.600
"Aye, the land has gotten brittle..."

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:04.760
"The Glen used to be in one piece, you know?"

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:07.940
"But now it's just a bunch of small islands that get smaller and smaller."

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:08.880
"Ah..."

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:10.780
So the barrens receded?

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:14.620
Like, the barrens used to be an ocean that receded and now it's... what it is.

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:15.800
Empty jar...

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:18.840
Fishing pole, jar of worms. Gross!

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:21.160
It's a bed. More like a mattress.

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:25.160
So... These peoople aren't robots. I think, anyway.

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:26.320
"Hm..."

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:27.160
"Nothing's biting..."

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:28.640
Maybe, nothing's in there.

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:31.440
Maybe there's just nothing left to any of this.

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:35.480
I dunno, but they seem to be having fun catching fireflies.

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:38.740
But if the fireflies are the only source of light that they got left.

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:40.080
"Alula?"

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:41.080
I don't know.

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:42.760
"Alula? Where did you go ?"

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:44.340
"Markiplier, did you hear that?"

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:45.620
"Alula?"

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:47.780
"I think it's coming from the south-east of here."

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:49.060
Aluullaaa?

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:51.240
Where you at Aluula..?

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:53.020
Alright, well how do I get to the south-east?

00:09:53.020 --> 00:09:54.740
Are you calling for Alula ?

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:56.800
"This is the best fishing spot I've found yet."

00:09:57.080 --> 00:09:59.600
"All the fish I catch here are longer than my arm."

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:02.920
Maybe that's short-arm Steve over there..

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:04.200
Stumpy arm Steve-

00:10:04.260 --> 00:10:05.200
"Hey! You there!"

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:06.820
Have you seen Alula??

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:11.580
"Have you seen a little girl..? She's a little bit shorter than you and..."

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:14.700
"Wait ! That's..the sunnn.."

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:16.760
"Are you our savior..?"

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:23.380
Yes....Yes I am, I talk to a god named Markiplier in my head...

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.960
"Oh my stars"

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:26.720
"Sorry for my rudeness"

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:28.240
"Huh? It's alright"

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:29.800
"Are you looking for someone?"

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:32.580
"My little sister...she's been gone for three days now"

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:34.380
"I've been looking all over but..."

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:35.580
"What's she look like ?"

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:40.980
"Umm, me but smaller, lil shorter, long blue hair, two blue fleathers.."

00:10:41.020 --> 00:10:42.700
"Okay, I'm sorry I haven't seen anyone like that"

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:44.360
"Where's the last place you saw her?"

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:46.540
"Back inside the ruins.."

00:10:46.920 --> 00:10:50.300
"She said she was headed towards the forest, so I'm waiting here now."

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:52.280
"I ran out of places to look..."

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:53.840
Alrighty then.

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:58.320
Good luck with that! I'm gonna try to find the ruins, I don't even know where that is.

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:00.020
I'm a newcomer to these lands

00:11:00.020 --> 00:11:04.600
so I don't exactly got my bearings about all this, if you could point me to a tourist center..?

00:11:04.860 --> 00:11:06.140
Maybe give me a map.

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:11.800
Send Dora The Explorer my way, maybe I'll get my way through here, but..until then I'm lost!

00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:13.740
I just keep travelling down.

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:14.760
Oh, hello.

00:11:14.760 --> 00:11:15.420
Robot.

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:19.040
"HELLO, PERSON. WELCOME TO THE RESEARCH STATION."

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:20.120
Hello.

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:22.620
"ARE YOU SENT HERE BY DOCTOR SILVERPOINT?"

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:25.320
"Nooo.." "OH, CARRY ON, THEN."

00:11:25.640 --> 00:11:29.780
So I need to find a doctor... 'Silverponty'... whatever he said.

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:31.620
Hello...hi.

00:11:32.440 --> 00:11:33.440
"No? I'm with Markiplier."

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:34.340
"Oh, carry on."

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:37.320
Hey, you don't care about the god that talks to me in my head?!

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:40.420
He's VERY loud and yelling a lot.

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:41.160
Hello?

00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:42.820
"How come you're red instead of green?"

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:44.260
"Well more of a purple than red.."

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:46.260
"But your eyes and stuff are red!"

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:50.120
"I AM ONLY HERE TO PICK UP THIS WEEK'S MOSS SAMPLES."

00:11:50.300 --> 00:11:52.180
"I WILL RETURN TO MY STATION IN THE CITY SOON."

00:11:52.180 --> 00:11:52.980
Oooh...

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:56.560
So they're color coordinated based on the... places that they are,

00:11:56.560 --> 00:12:00.460
so the ones from here are more of a green, the ones back in the barrens were more of a blue.

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:03.320
Uhh. So the land you come from is weird.

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:06.060
